cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies
  (preferred-citation below).
title: >-
  Single-cell analysis code for Erdem et al. 2026 (Diabetologia)
abstract: >-
  Reproduces the single-cell RNA-seq figures (Fig. 1j, Fig. 1k and ESM Fig. 2a)
  from Erdem et al., Human pancreatic ductal cells from non-diabetic donors
  function as non-professional antigen-presenting cells upon inflammatory
  cytokine exposure, Diabetologia 2026. Covers only the computational analysis
  of publicly available PanKBase data.
type: software
license: MIT
